  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-01-25T23:03:46.864Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to request a way to set a \"default\" login status, so when you crash, or leave, the next time you join, you aren't on blue (auto join) status.  Either set status to green on restart, or let users choose their own default.  (Blue, Green, Orange, Red, or \"last used\").\nThis would save a lot of surprise visits in your homeworld from people when you are just logging in the next day after a party the night before, or people joining on you at home after you crashed during an event.",
